    affiliation: "aSSIST University (Seoul School of Integrated Sciences and Technologies)"
version: "1.1"
date-released: "2026-10-28"
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/ShuyaoGao/snake-dqn-brain"
url: "https://ShuyaoGao.github.io/snake-dqn-brain/play/"
abstract: >-
  A browser-only teaching demo (AI Teaching Demos): four trained Snake policies (two 100M-step PPO
  convolutional networks and an MLP from open-source projects, plus a small Double DQN trained here)
  play while a live "brain panel" shows the real activations, contributions, action scores and state
  value computed from the weights in plain JavaScript. Brains can be switched and compared on the same
  fixed games; neurons can be knocked out. Includes a NumPy reference implementation, the export tool
  for Stable-Baselines3 policies and the DQN training code.
keywords:
  - course-demo
  - reinforcement-learning
  - deep-q-network
  - proximal-policy-optimization
  - convolutional-neural-network
